@startuml consultarEstadoGuias-analisis
skinparam linetype polyline

left to right direction

rectangle #CDEBA5 ":PROGRAMA_ABIERTO" as ProgramaAbierto
rectangle #CDEBA5 ":GUIAS_DEL_PROGRAMA_ABIERTO" as GuiasDelProgramaSalida

package consultarEstadoGuias as "consultarEstadoGuias()" {
    rectangle #629EF9 ConsultarEstadoGuiasView
    rectangle #b5bd68 GuiaController
    rectangle #F2AC4E Guia
    rectangle #F2AC4E GuiaRepository
}

ProgramaAbierto --> ConsultarEstadoGuiasView: <font size=8>consultarEstadoGuias(programaId) [DirectorPrograma o Admin]

ConsultarEstadoGuiasView --> GuiaController: <font size=8>listarGuiasDelPrograma(programaId) : List<Guia>

GuiaController --> GuiaRepository: <font size=8>listarDelPrograma(programaId) : List<Guia>
note right: gate previo: admin o dirige el programa (404 uniforme)

GuiaController --> Guia: <font size=8>tienePdfGenerado() : boolean [por fila, para la variante Admin]

GuiaRepository -- Guia

ConsultarEstadoGuiasView --> GuiasDelProgramaSalida: <font size=8>presenta listado (fila DirectorPrograma: [Abrir]; fila Admin: [Previsualizar] + [Descargar PDF])

@enduml
